(Introduction) Tj T*
(Purpose) Tj T*
(This Assessment, covering Fiscal Year 2021 \(October 1, 2020 - September 30, 2021\), evaluates the performance of the) Tj T*
(state and local fusion centers against a common set of measures related to key outputs and direct outcomes.) Tj T*
(The Assessment process is intended to provide a comprehensive picture of the performance of the National) Tj T*
(Network of Fusion Centers \(National Network\) in order to help its partners and stakeholders identify strengths) Tj T*
(and challenges, track progress or trends over time.) Tj T*
ET
